   "title": "Good brisket Not cold beer. Flies on patio",
   "snippet": "If you want Texas barbeque, go to this restaurant. This was one of the few times that I had more than I could eat. The brisket was the best I have ever had, however I would not order the turkey again. There was a line to order, however it moved quickly. When we got our food, there was no place to sit; so we had to go out to the patio. This is not a good spot since we had to constantly fight flies. My beer was not cold",
