  {
   "position": 3,
   "title": "BBQ - Brisket that Melts in your Mouth.",
   "snippet": "We were excited to visit.  This was featured on Triple D.  It is a well oiled machine. Line moved quickly atmosphere is perfect.  We chose a 1 meat plate and 3 meat plate and ordered pork ribs, brisket, turkey and pulled pork.  Brisket was the winner.  Fork tender and excellent smoke. Sides we chose where homemade fries, Mac and cheese, Brussel sprouts in a mildly spicy sweet sauce.  Best BB ever had and we have had a lot.  Not like your mom used to make you eat.  Overall we were so very pleased and will definitely visit again when we return.",
