  {
   "position": 8,
   "title": "Great place for a private party with excellent BBQ!",
   "snippet": "We were here for a private party which meant our food was served buffet style.  Our choices of meats were: Beef Brisket, St. Louis Pork Ribs, Jalapeno-Cheddar Sausage, or Beef Ribs.  The sides were potato salad and coleslaw.  Everything was amazing!  All the meats were smokey and tender.  The beef ribs were enormous!  One person took a rib and shared it with 3 or 4 other people.  I've had a lot of BBQ in Texas, but this meat was the best, the moistest, the most tender of any I've had!  The potato salad had something special in it, also very tasty.  The coleslaw was crunchy and flavorful.  Since we were having a private party, we also got a tour of the BBQ pit.  The two guys were full of information about the process of creating the wonderful meats.",
   "rating": 5,
