  {
   "position": 10,
   "title": "Rawhide Rib",
   "snippet": "I admired this place as it was speical, good, fun, different.\nI pony up for a beef rib as a bday treat \nIt was the worst barbecue I can recall eating almost ever.\nI am sure it was a fluke, not common, and unusual.  Owner tried to guilt me into not posting or commenting.  Said I was childish, needing help.\n\nSaid I\u2019ll give you your money back.\nNot about the money I told him.\nIt\u2019s about how it happened on the first place.  Sending food back or getting reimbursed is an easy out and never a solution.  He stated I basically was wrong about it all.\n\nSo therefore I will eat there again even if somone is buying or it\u2019s catered.",
